38
00:03:19.791 --> 00:03:21.958
Hey, hey, hey, hey! Steal my jacket!

39
00:03:22.041 --> 00:03:24.333
Steal my jacket! (continues in Chinese)

40
00:03:24.416 --> 00:03:27.666
(electronic music plays briefly
